though 22600 is a point on a trendline while created from connecting 2024 election low and recent monthly candle low so we can go till there and rest sometimes there. and finally if those levels also gone we have to pray only in that case because we can see major panic (i don't the reason, it could be crude also or it could be RBI policy rate hike also or any deal or No deal or anything) but in current scenario we will have levels first and news will follow (as ravi kishan said so);

